paper/main.pdf
# Regenerable arXiv upload bundle (main.tex + sections + tables + main.bbl).
# Rebuild with: pdflatex -> bibtex -> pdflatex -> pdflatex, then tar the sources + .bbl.
paper/arxiv-submission.tar.gz
# NOTE: arXiv wants main.bbl uploaded with the source (it does not reliably run
# bibtex). At submission, generate it and include it in the upload even though
# it is ignored here.

# --- Session scratch (tool output dumps, not project content) ---
grill-me-output.txt

# --- Convenience copy of the compiled paper (regenerable, see paper/) ---
/When-Chats-Split-Apart.pdf

# --- Source narrative for the motivating incident (real personal account, not chat data,
# but not for the permanently-archived public repo; keep local as evidentiary source) ---
/actual_problem.md

# --- Peer-review artefact (input to a revision pass, not project content) ---
/peer-review-report.docx
